  subjects:
  - 'From:HeadSecurity@XCEL.Com

    You made it!'
  greetings:
  - "Ok, that\u2019s all for today. Tommorow you\u2019ll start your job properly,
    and you\u2019re going to be running into these phishing scams, so keep your eyes
    peeled!\n\nAlso as a side note, can\u2019t believe we gotta run this for every
    new hire, like does management think we\u2019re old people who can get scammed
    like this? We\u2019re not that slow man.\n\nAnyway your supervisor should be
    contacting you first thing tomorrow, so report to them. "
  part1s:
  - Sounds good. Also yeah, what do they take us for?
  part2s:
  - "Thanks! I\u2019ll talk to them tomorrow, and also don\u2019t get too confident,
    or else you might fall for one!"
  part3s:
  - See you tomorrow. And haha, agreed
  signoffs:
  - Hi
  phishing:
  - No
